{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17673","headline":"息舟荆溪入阳羡南山游善权寺呈李功曹巨 · 羊士谔","name":"息舟荆溪入阳羡南山游善权寺呈李功曹巨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"结缆兰香渚，柴车上连冈。\n晏温值初霁，去遶山河长。\n献岁冰雪尽，细泉生路傍。\n行披烟杉入，激涧横石梁。\n层阁表精庐，飞甍切云翔。\n冲襟得高步，清眺极远方。\n潭嶂积佳气，荑英多早芳。\n具观泽国秀，重使春心伤。\n念遵烦促途，荣利骛隟光。\n勉君脱冠意，共匿无何乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"羊士谔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17673.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17673","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}